OL,3,GNEWSASolar farm plan sparks fears of   
OL,4,Anew industrialisation for ex-pit areas 
OL,6,F"We have spent decades repairing the   
OL,7,Fdamage of the past. Please don't ask us
OL,8,Fto do it again," says Julian Morley as 
OL,9,Fhe holds up a lump of South Yorkshire  
OL,10,Fcoal for all the audience and panel in 
OL,11,Fa Rotherham conference room to see.    
OL,13,FMorley, a parish councillor in         
OL,14,FHarthill, is speaking to a meeting of  
OL,15,Flocal residents, farmers, the area's MP
OL,16,Fand the mayor of South Yorkshire to    
OL,17,Fargue against plans to build a         
OL,18,Flarge-scale solar farm between         
OL,19,FDoncaster and Rotherham - with         
OL,20,Frepresentatives of the firm behind the 
OL,21,Fproposals also in attendance.          
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
