OL,3,GNEWSASolar farm plan sparks fears of   
OL,4,Anew industrialisation for ex-pit areas 
OL,6,FThe human and environmental cost of    
OL,7,Fanother form of energy production -    
OL,8,Fcoal - is well known to the people of  
OL,9,FSouth Yorkshire, with slag heaps and   
OL,10,Fblackened lungs still well within      
OL,11,Fliving memory for many who recall when 
OL,12,Fpit wheels still dotted the landscape. 
OL,14,FSeveral decades on from when those     
OL,15,Fmines began to close, local residents  
OL,16,Fsay they fear they now face a new wave 
OL,17,Fof industrialisation, though of a very 
OL,18,Fdifferent kind.                        
